WEBVTT

00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:14,170
Have you seen an increase in cancer since the COVID vaccine?

00:00:14,170 --> 00:00:17,210
I think cancer rates since the COVID vaccine.

00:00:17,210 --> 00:00:22,210
Well, it's dangerous question to ask without the cancels,

00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:27,570
but we have had comments from people.

00:00:27,570 --> 00:00:29,850
I think we actually just spoke to a person,

00:00:29,850 --> 00:00:31,130
we're able to spoke to a person

00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:33,410
that we followed a couple of weeks ago that said

00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:37,930
that this person and their eight siblings

00:00:37,930 --> 00:00:42,490
had to get vaccinated in order to see their dying mother

00:00:42,490 --> 00:00:45,050
in hospice.

00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:48,930
And within a year, all eight siblings

00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:50,290
have a diagnosis cancer.

00:00:50,290 --> 00:00:51,710
That's great dramatic.

00:00:53,010 --> 00:00:58,010
We've spoken to people in the fold with these kind of comments

00:01:00,050 --> 00:01:03,250
that had not, their cancer was in remission.

00:01:03,250 --> 00:01:04,290
They got the vaccine.

00:01:04,290 --> 00:01:06,450
The cancer came back with a vengeance

00:01:06,450 --> 00:01:08,730
right after the vaccine.

00:01:08,730 --> 00:01:13,730
The vaccine does have an immune suppression component to it

00:01:14,770 --> 00:01:16,010
that can cause that.

00:01:16,010 --> 00:01:19,530
There can be other physiological causes to that.

00:01:19,530 --> 00:01:23,210
If you went to Google and you searched,

00:01:23,210 --> 00:01:25,530
has there been an increased cancer rate since the vaccine?

00:01:25,530 --> 00:01:28,530
You get the exact opposite response,

00:01:28,530 --> 00:01:32,250
but Google has been filtered in anything that shows,

00:01:32,250 --> 00:01:35,090
any studies that have shown different than that

00:01:35,090 --> 00:01:38,410
have been taken off of Google.

00:01:38,410 --> 00:01:41,210
I've seen multiple studies from Europe that showed

00:01:41,210 --> 00:01:44,370
that there's increased cancer rate of people

00:01:44,370 --> 00:01:47,570
that have been vaccinated, increased cancer growth

00:01:47,570 --> 00:01:49,570
of people that have been vaccinated,

00:01:49,570 --> 00:01:52,090
but you'll won't find any of those on Google

00:01:52,090 --> 00:01:57,090
because Google is a branch of the pharmaceutical propaganda arm.

00:01:58,530 --> 00:02:01,050
So it is, you won't see that on that.

00:02:01,050 --> 00:02:05,050
So we have seen an increase,

00:02:06,050 --> 00:02:09,570
and I don't know the complete physiology of that,

00:02:09,570 --> 00:02:12,250
but I've never been pro-vaccine of any kind,

00:02:12,250 --> 00:02:13,570
certainly not that one.

